{"id":"u-72107402-8967-4577-8869-37394e915cd2","src":"community","title":"6-Day Gym Split","author":"Yasmin C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/RT5dYQ-6-day-gym-split","desc":"A 4-week, 6-day split for dedicated lifters that combines glute-focused strength training with upper-body, core, and conditioning days. Days 1 and 4 build the glutes, hamstrings, and quads with hip thrusts, Romanian deadlifts, squats, Bulgarian split squats, lunges, and abductor work. Day 2 works the back and shoulders, and Day 5 covers chest, back, shoulders, and arms. Day 3 is dedicated to core with planks, Russian twists, hanging leg raises, and bicycle crunches, followed by a stair climber session. Day 6 is a conditioning day with goblet squats, kettlebell swings, lunges, and mountain climbers, finished with a treadmill walk. Cardio is built into three of the days, so the program builds a stronger lower body, a sculpted upper body, and better endurance.","level":["Novice"],"goals":["Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-22T00:18:53.632Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Glutes & Hamstrings","Back & Shoulders","Core & Cardio","Glutes Focus","Upper Body","Full Body + Cardio"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Kickback (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":600}],"note":"Incline Walk"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":2700,"x":3}]},{"n":"Russian Twist (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicycle C